# EXPECT: a degree with neither fraternal:degreeRank nor fraternal:degreeKind
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix fraternal: <https://w3id.org/fraternal#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://example.org/invalid/> .

ex:S a skos:ConceptScheme , fraternal:DegreeSystem ; skos:prefLabel "Ladder"@en .
ex:d1 a fraternal:Degree ; skos:inScheme ex:S ; skos:prefLabel "One"@en ;
    fraternal:degreeRank 1 .
ex:floating a fraternal:Degree ; skos:inScheme ex:S ; skos:prefLabel "Floating degree"@en .
